{id:5003,q:"A high-risk customer is more likely to buy generous insurance. This is...",options:["Adverse selection","Moral hazard","Transfer pricing","Shirking"],a:0,tag:"adverse_selection",type:"interpretation",objective:"LO19.2",feedback:"The customer’s risk type is hidden before the insurance contract is made."}
