{id:5029,q:"A division decision can be bad for the parent company if it...",options:["Raises division results while lowering total firm profit","Improves total firm profit","Requires coordination","Uses accurate information"],a:0,tag:"parent_company",type:"interpretation",objective:"LO22.1",feedback:"Local division incentives can conflict with the parent company's broader goal."}
