{id:5037,q:"One advantage of functional units is...",options:["Specialization within departments","Perfect coordination across all units","Elimination of all agency costs","No need for managers"],a:0,tag:"functional_units",type:"interpretation",objective:"LO22.4",feedback:"Functional units allow people with similar expertise to work together."}
