{id:5043,q:"A manager overstates expected costs to receive a larger budget. This is...",options:["Budget gaming","Signaling","Monitoring","Insurance pooling"],a:0,tag:"budget_games",type:"interpretation",objective:"LO22.7",feedback:"The manager is padding the budget request to make the target easier or gain more resources."}
