{id:6011,q:"A company gives employees unlimited expense accounts, and spending rises sharply. What is the likely issue?",options:["Moral hazard because employees no longer bear the full cost","Adverse selection because employees were high risk before hiring","Signaling because employees reveal quality","Transfer pricing between departments"],a:0,tag:"moral_hazard",type:"diagnostic",objective:"LO20.2",feedback:"When people do not bear the full cost of their choices, behavior may change."}
