{id:6013,q:"A delivery firm tracks routes to see whether drivers take inefficient detours. This is mainly a response to...",options:["Hidden action after employment begins","Hidden type before hiring only","Seller quality before purchase","Transfer pricing between divisions"],a:0,tag:"monitoring",type:"diagnostic",objective:"LO20.3",feedback:"Route tracking monitors behavior after the employment relationship begins."}
